        189.59
      ],
      "text": "ORDER U/S 163 OF THE BHARTIYA NAGARIK SURAKSHA SANHITA, 2023"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 5,
      "poly": [
        52.68,
        200.36,
        535.41,
        200.36,
        535.41,
        248.38,
        52.68,
        248.38
      ],
      "text": "WHEREAS, a substantial number of trucks and goods carriers regularly transit through Silvassa City from nearby industrial areas;"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 6,
      "poly": [
        52.68,
        253.35,
        537.14,
        253.35,
        537.14,
        328.69,
        52.68,
        328.69
      ],
      "text": "AND WHEREAS, the movement of heavy vehicles within city limits during the ongoing Ganpati Festival period may cause traffic congestion, pose safety risks to pedestrians, and hinder emergency response services;"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 7,
      "poly": [
        52.68,
        333.65,
        538.87,
        333.65,
        538.87,
        408.17,
        52.68,
        408.17
      ],
      "text": "AND WHEREAS, it is necessary to regulate the entry of heavy vehicles into Silvassa City and nearby areas to ensure public safety, maintain smooth traffic flow, and facilitate peaceful celebration of the Ganpati Festival;"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 8,
      "poly": [
        52.68,
        414.79,
        540.6,
        414.79,
        540.6,
        543.12,
        52.68,
        543.12
      ],
      "text": "THEREFORE, in view of above and in exercise of the power conferral under Section 163 of the Bhartiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023, I, Amit Kumar, Sub-Divisional Magistrate, Dadra & Nagar Haveli hereby order that the following roads shall remain closed for heavy vehicles entering and passing through Silvassa during the following time slots:"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 9,
      "poly": [
        58.72,
        569.61,
        495.69,
        569.61,
        495.69,
        609.35,
        58.72,
        609.35
      ],
      "text": "Entry Restriction Timing: Morning: From 06:00 AM to 10:00 AM\nEvening: From 04:00 PM to 10:00 PM"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 10,
      "poly": [
        52.68,
        627.57,
        171.85,
        627.57,
        171.85,
        644.95,
        52.68,
        644.95
      ],
      "text": "Restricted Routes:"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 11,
      "poly": [
        82.04,
        656.54,
        471.51,
        656.54,
        471.51,
        738.51,
        82.04,
        738.51
      ],
      "text": "1) Khanvel to Silvassa Road via Rakholi, Masat, Samarvarni\n2) Naroli to Silvassa Road via Kharapada, Athal\n3) Dadra to Silvassa Road via Pipariya\n4) Sayli to Silvassa Road via Baldevi"
    },
